{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And your mighty men shall be dismayed, O Teman</b> — Perhaps he mentioned it to emphasize the strength of your mighty men, for they are from Teman, because he is of the children of Edom." "<b>That every man may be cut off</b> — From the abundance of slaughter, so that no fugitive remains." "And the meaning of <b>למען</b> — it is joined with <b>והאבדתי</b>."], :book :obadiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Obadiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=18&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:31.832236635Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}